# ===== Bifurc — Electron desktop app =====
# This repository holds the Electron app only, and the app lives at the repo root.
# The companion browser extension (`bifurc-extension`) and the website
# (`bifurc-studio`) are separate repositories with their own .gitignore files.

# ===== Dependencies =====
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# ===== Build Outputs =====
dist/
release/
out/
*.app
*.exe
*.dmg
*.deb
*.rpm
# tsup transpiles a TS config to a temp `.mjs` beside it and normally removes it, but an
# interrupted build leaves it behind — and `prepare` now builds both workspace packages on
# every install, so it shows up often enough to be worth ignoring.
tsup.config.bundled_*.mjs

# ===== Test Coverage & Reports =====
# Alternate report dirs (`coverage-run`, `coverage-run3`, …) are used when the
# environment blocks Vitest's bulk delete of `coverage/` — see TESTING.md §1.
coverage/
coverage-*/
.nyc_output/
test-results/
playwright-report/

# ===== Runtime Data =====
userData/
*.asar
*.asar.unpacked/
.vite/

